    "content": [
      {
        "text": "This policy establishes the standards governing the evaluation, eligibility, and acceptance of collateral "
      },
      {
        "text": "for secured financing within the Capital Markets Lending Desk. It ensures alignment with regulatory",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": " expectations, internal credit risk frameworks, and enterprise-wide collateral management standards. "
      },
      {
        "text": "The policy aims to maintain high-quality collateral pools, protect the institution from counterparty",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": " default, and promote consistent decision-making."
      }
    ],
