    "end_line": 4,
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
      {
        "text": "This policy applies to all secured financing transactions originated, renewed, or amended by the Capital"
      },
      {
        "text": "Markets Lending Desk. It covers all client types\u2014including financial institutions, corporates, and asset",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": "managers\u2014across the U.S. and Canada. Exclusions include retail lending, margin lending"
      },
      {
        "text": "administered by the Prime Brokerage unit, and collateral processes governed by bilateral derivative",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": "agreements."
      }
    ],
