    "id": "p1_b6_5ccbe880",
    "page": 1,
    "block_num": 6,
    "start_line": 6,
    "end_line": 6,
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
      {
        "text": "- All collateral must meet eligibility criteria defined by Credit Risk Management."
      },
      {
        "text": "- Collateral must be independently valued using approved pricing sources.",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": "- Haircuts must follow enterprise-approved schedules and be applied consistently."
      },
      {
        "text": "- Legal enforceability must be validated through internal or external counsel prior to transaction",
        "bold": true
      },
      {
        "text": "onboarding."
      },
      {
        "text": "- Concentration limits, wrong-way risk controls, and re-hypothecation restrictions must be adhered to."
      },
      {
        "text": "- Documentation must include collateral schedules, valuation statements, and legal opinions."
      }
    ],
